{title: 378 - Go, Preach My Gospel}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #378 • TRURO • 8.9.8.8}
{lyricist: Isaac Watts}
{composer: T. Williams' Psalmodia Evangelica}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 378}
{meta: tune TRURO}
{meta: meter 8.9.8.8}
{meta: category Christian Church - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C/E]"Go, preach [G7]My [F/C]gospel," [G]saith [Dm/A]the [G]Lord;
[C/G]"Bid [G]the [C/E]whole [G7]world My [F/C]grace [G7/F]receive;
[C/E]He [G]shall [C]be saved [F]who [G]trusts My word,
[G]And [C/G]they [F#m]condemned [C/G]who [F]disbelieve.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C/E]"I'll make [G7]your [F/C]great [C/G]commission [G]known,
[C/G]And [G]ye [C/E]shall prove [G7]My [C]gospel true
[C/E]By [G]all [C]the works [F]that [G]I have done,
[G]By [C/G]all [F#m]the [G]wonders [F]ye [Dm/A]shall [G]do.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C/E]"Teach all [G7]the [F/C]nations [G]My [Dm/A]commands;
[C/G]I'm [G]with [C/E]you till [G7]the [C]world [G7/F]shall [C/G]end;
[C/E]All [G]power [C]is [F]vested [G]in My hands;
[G]I [C/G]can [F#m]destroy, [C/G]and [F]I [Dm/A]defend."
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C/E]He spake, [G7]and [F/C]light [C/G]shone [G]round [Dm/A]His [G]head;
[C/G]On [G]a [C/E]bright cloud [G7]to heaven He [C/G]rode;
[C/E]They [G]to [C]the farthest [G]nations spread
[G]The [C/G]grace [F#m]of [G]their [C/G]ascended [G]Lord.
{end_of_verse}
